    "body": "Yes, I always speak (maybe too much) only for myself as a web-author, I don't have any affiliation with any vendor.\r\n\r\nRegarding the changes I still find the discrepancy between `font` being converted to `px` and these values kept as relative `<length>` a bit surprising (`\"2vw\"` may represent two different values entirely just by resizing the window), but overall I don't have strong opinions.",
